title: "Digital biomarker analysis code for major depressive disorder using wrist-worn wearable data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for deriving digital biomarkers of major depressive disorder from
  wrist-worn wearable data (sleep, heart rate variability, and physical activity).
  Includes preprocessing, orthogonal polynomial trajectory representation,
  cross-validated discrimination, and SHAP-based feature importance.
type: software
